      "content": "3.1 Scope and Importance of Horticulture"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Horticulture covers the broad scope, cultivation, and economic importance of fruits, vegetables, and floriculture in India.",
        "Plant propagation is fundamentally divided into Sexual Propagation (seeds) and Vegetative / Asexual Propagation.",
        "Post-Harvest Technology focuses on reducing post-harvest losses and implementing effective storage methods for perishable produce.",
        "Understanding major fruits and vegetables of India is crucial for studying horticultural productivity and agricultural management."
      ],
